        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7a5416df-4de0-3403-8a86-e971f3b18656",
                "word": "sinciput",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c250e0f3-8172-492e-859f-f92c1aba669e",
                        "entry_id": "7a5416df-4de0-3403-8a86-e971f3b18656",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "sinciputs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0bba7469-8f44-3a96-a718-a5b29247e192",
                        "entry_id": "7a5416df-4de0-3403-8a86-e971f3b18656",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Partie supérieure de la tête, par opposition à l’occiput."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4a366c2-49b1-490b-9c2f-96fcbfd5ac77",
                                "sense_id": "0bba7469-8f44-3a96-a718-a5b29247e192",
                                "text": "Au sommet de mon sinciput, se dressait un cône tronqué en feutre mou de trente centimètres de haut, dont la base, ceinte de larges ailes, laissait échapper des flots de cheveux bruns."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07cd96cb-b7ff-4b22-9cb0-94ae0bb29140",
                                "sense_id": "0bba7469-8f44-3a96-a718-a5b29247e192",
                                "text": "Noirs de loupes, grêlés, les yeux cerclés de bagues\nVertes, leurs doigts boulus crispés à leurs fémurs,\nLe sinciput plaqué de hargnosités vagues\nComme les floraisons lépreuses des vieux murs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27f3ba9a-2e42-4ec1-ae67-caffb2662237",
                                "sense_id": "0bba7469-8f44-3a96-a718-a5b29247e192",
                                "text": "Un beau militaire, habillé à la militaire, avec la tunique kaki à brandebourgs pareils, le calot crânement posé de traviole sur le sinciput et les grosses écrase-merde cloutées qui crissaient sur notre plancher fraîchement ciré."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a8005ff9-b2da-4502-9942-76339d5fac57",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a5416df-4de0-3403-8a86-e971f3b18656",
                        "source_sense_id": "0bba7469-8f44-3a96-a718-a5b29247e192",
                        "target_lang_word": "Vorderkopf",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e344007-0f79-4982-baf7-e2e7893404cc",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a5416df-4de0-3403-8a86-e971f3b18656",
                        "source_sense_id": "0bba7469-8f44-3a96-a718-a5b29247e192",
                        "target_lang_word": "sinciput",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sinciput",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                        "entry_id": "43a6091a-9d14-3914-ab86-e764e2ad252d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The front part of the head or skull (as contradistinct from occiput)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ef4094b-f79d-45eb-b8f5-97cb6c0c0b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                                "text": "The cranial anomalies occurred either in the occiput or the sinciput, approximately twice as often in the occiput as in the sinciput.\nSuch lesions have been considered to be inoperable when they involved the sinciput."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e05c5833-321b-4edd-9c42-371846580ba8",
                                                "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                                "text": "Between these two extremes lie the sinciput presentation and the brow presentation. Thus there are four distinct attitudes: vertex, sinciput, brow, and face (Figure 15-7)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcd9389a-ef4e-427f-9013-52a78f1dcf6b",
                                                "sense_id": "05ae6a7e-417c-3537-b9ee-d1b358b248f3",
                                                "text": "I learnt to develop a ‘feel’ for the sinciput and the occiput as these landmarks feel different abdominally, and also their ‘whereabouts’ in relationship to the pelvic brim. Therefore, when descent and flexion were taking place, I learnt to ascertain how the positions of the sinciput and occiput would change in relationship to each other and in relationship to the pelvic brim."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
